{"id": "h01", "genre": "history", "split": "dev", "familiar": true, "title": "Gandhi and the salt march", "cast": {"gandhi": {"kind": "person", "name": "Gandhi", "known": "gandhi"}, "sea": {"kind": "place", "name": "the sea"}, "ashram": {"kind": "place", "name": "his ashram"}, "stick": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a walking stick", "words": ["stick"]}, "people": {"kind": "group", "name": "Many people", "words": ["people", "crowd"]}, "road": {"kind": "place", "name": "the long road", "words": ["road"]}, "beach": {"kind": "place", "name": "the beach at Dandi", "words": ["beach", "dandi"], "noun": "beach"}, "mud": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a handful of salty mud", "words": ["mud", "handful"], "noun": "mud"}}, "lines": [{"text": "In 1930, Gandhi decided to walk to the sea to make salt.", "ev": [{"act": "decide", "by": "gandhi", "never": true}]}, {"text": "He left his ashram with a walking stick in his hand.", "ev": [{"act": "leave", "by": "gandhi", "to": "ashram"}, {"act": "hold", "by": "gandhi", "obj": "stick"}], "rel": [["gandhi", "hold", "stick"]]}, {"text": "Many people followed him on the long road.", "ev": [{"act": "follow", "by": "people", "to": "gandhi"}], "rel": [["people", "behind", "gandhi"]]}, {"text": "They walked for twenty four days through villages and towns.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "gandhi"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "people"}]}, {"text": "At last Gandhi reached the beach at Dandi.", "ev": [{"act": "arrive", "by": "gandhi", "to": "beach"}]}, {"text": "He bent down and picked up a handful of salty mud.", "ev": [{"act": "crouch", "by": "gandhi"}, {"act": "pick_up", "by": "gandhi", "obj": "mud"}]}, {"text": "He held it up and said, with this I shake the empire.", "ev": [{"act": "lift", "by": "gandhi", "obj": "mud"}, {"act": "say", "by": "gandhi"}]}, {"text": "The crowd cheered loudly.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "people", "val": "happy"}]}, {"text": "Soon people all over India were making their own salt.", "ev": [{"act": "spread", "by": "people", "never": true}]}]},
{"id": "h02", "genre": "history", "split": "dev", "familiar": false, "title": "The messenger and the fort", "cast": {"messenger": {"kind": "person", "name": "a young messenger"}, "village": {"kind": "place", "name": "a village"}, "fort": {"kind": "place", "name": "a stone fort"}, "torches": {"kind": "prop", "name": "torches"}, "forest": {"kind": "place", "name": "the forest"}, "army": {"kind": "group", "name": "An enemy army"}, "horse": {"kind": "animal", "name": "his horse"}, "hill": {"kind": "place", "name": "the hill"}, "gate": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the big wooden gate", "words": ["gate"]}, "guards": {"kind": "group", "name": "the guards"}, "soldiers": {"kind": "group", "name": "The soldiers"}, "walls": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the walls"}, "bows": {"kind": "prop", "name": "their bows"}, "king": {"kind": "person", "name": "The king", "gender": "he"}, "medal": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a gold medal"}}, "lines": [{"text": "Long ago, a young messenger lived in a village below a stone fort.", "ev": [], "rel": [["messenger", "in", "village"], ["village", "under", "fort"]]}, {"text": "One night he saw torches moving in the forest.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "messenger", "to": "torches"}], "rel": [["torches", "in", "forest"]]}, {"text": "An enemy army was coming towards the village.", "ev": [{"act": "go", "by": "army", "to": "village"}], "rel": [["army", "towards", "village"]]}, {"text": "The messenger jumped on his horse and rode up the hill.", "ev": [{"act": "ride", "by": "messenger", "to": "horse"}, {"act": "go", "by": "messenger", "to": "hill"}], "rel": [["messenger", "ride", "horse"]]}, {"text": "He galloped through the gate of the fort.", "ev": [{"act": "enter", "by": "messenger", "to": "fort"}]}, {"text": "He shouted to the guards, the enemy is coming.", "ev": [{"act": "shout", "by": "messenger", "to": "guards"}]}, {"text": "The guards closed the big wooden gate.", "ev": [{"act": "close", "by": "guards", "obj": "gate"}]}, {"text": "The soldiers climbed onto the walls with their bows.", "ev": [{"act": "climb", "by": "soldiers", "to": "walls"}, {"act": "hold", "by": "soldiers", "obj": "bows"}], "rel": [["soldiers", "on", "walls"]]}, {"text": "When the army saw the fort was ready, they turned back.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "army", "to": "fort"}, {"act": "leave", "by": "army"}]}, {"text": "The king gave the messenger a gold medal.", "ev": [{"act": "give", "by": "king", "obj": "medal", "to": "messenger"}]}]},
{"id": "h03", "genre": "history", "split": "dev", "familiar": true, "title": "Columbus sails west", "cast": {"columbus": {"kind": "person", "name": "Columbus", "known": "columbus"}, "ship": {"kind": "prop", "name": "his ship"}, "ocean": {"kind": "place", "name": "the wide ocean", "words": ["ocean", "sea"]}, "sailors": {"kind": "group", "name": "the sailors"}, "sailor": {"kind": "person", "name": "a sailor"}, "mast": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the mast"}, "land": {"kind": "place", "name": "land"}, "island": {"kind": "place", "name": "a green island"}, "beach": {"kind": "place", "name": "the beach"}, "sand": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the sand"}}, "lines": [{"text": "In 1492, Columbus stood on the deck of his ship.", "ev": [{"act": "stand", "by": "columbus"}], "rel": [["columbus", "on", "ship"]]}, {"text": "The ship sailed west across the wide ocean.", "ev": [{"act": "sail", "by": "ship", "to": "ocean"}]}, {"text": "Days passed and the sailors grew tired and afraid.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "sailors", "val": "scared"}]}, {"text": "Some sailors shouted at Columbus, we must go back.", "ev": [{"act": "shout", "by": "sailors", "to": "columbus"}]}, {"text": "Columbus looked at the sea and said, wait three more days.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "columbus", "to": "ocean"}, {"act": "say", "by": "columbus", "to": "sailors"}]}, {"text": "On the third night a sailor climbed the mast.", "ev": [{"act": "climb", "by": "sailor", "to": "mast"}], "rel": [["sailor", "on", "mast"]]}, {"text": "He pointed at the land ahead and shouted, land, land.", "ev": [{"act": "point", "by": "sailor", "to": "land"}, {"act": "shout", "by": "sailor"}]}, {"text": "The next morning the ship reached a green island.", "ev": [{"act": "arrive", "by": "ship", "to": "island"}]}, {"text": "Columbus stepped onto the beach and knelt on the sand.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "columbus", "to": "beach"}, {"act": "kneel", "by": "columbus"}], "rel": [["columbus", "on", "sand"]]}]},
{"id": "h04", "genre": "history", "split": "val", "familiar": false, "title": "The young scribe and the library fire", "cast": {"city": {"kind": "place", "name": "an old city"}, "library": {"kind": "place", "name": "a great library"}, "scrolls": {"kind": "prop", "name": "scrolls"}, "tara": {"kind": "person", "name": "A young scribe named Tara", "words": ["tara", "scribe"]}, "books": {"kind": "prop", "name": "books"}, "smoke": {"kind": "agent", "name": "smoke"}, "shelves": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the shelves"}, "basket": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a big basket"}, "people": {"kind": "group", "name": "people"}, "buckets": {"kind": "prop", "name": "buckets of water", "words": ["buckets"]}, "flames": {"kind": "agent", "name": "the flames", "words": ["flames", "fire"]}, "librarian": {"kind": "person", "name": "The old librarian"}}, "lines": [{"text": "In an old city there was a great library full of scrolls.", "ev": [], "rel": [["library", "in", "city"], ["scrolls", "in", "library"]]}, {"text": "A young scribe named Tara worked there copying books.", "ev": [{"act": "write", "by": "tara", "obj": "books"}], "rel": [["tara", "in", "library"]]}, {"text": "One evening she smelled smoke from the roof.", "ev": [{"act": "smell", "by": "tara", "never": true}]}, {"text": "Tara ran to the shelves and grabbed as many scrolls as she could.", "ev": [{"act": "run", "by": "tara", "to": "shelves"}, {"act": "pick_up", "by": "tara", "obj": "scrolls"}]}, {"text": "She put them in a big basket.", "ev": [{"act": "put", "by": "tara", "obj": "scrolls", "to": "basket"}], "rel": [["scrolls", "in", "basket"]]}, {"text": "Then she carried the basket out of the burning library.", "ev": [{"act": "carry", "by": "tara", "obj": "basket"}, {"act": "leave", "by": "tara", "to": "library"}], "rel": [["tara", "hold", "basket"]]}, {"text": "Outside, people threw buckets of water on the flames.", "ev": [{"act": "throw", "by": "people", "obj": "buckets", "to": "flames"}]}, {"text": "By morning the fire was out, but half the library was gone.", "ev": [{"act": "burn_out", "by": "flames", "never": true}]}, {"text": "The old librarian hugged Tara and cried with joy.", "ev": [{"act": "hug", "by": "librarian", "to": "tara"}, {"act": "react", "by": "librarian", "val": "happy"}]}, {"text": "The scrolls she saved are still read today.", "ev": [{"act": "be_read", "by": "scrolls", "never": true}]}]},
{"id": "h05", "genre": "history", "split": "test", "familiar": true, "title": "Shivaji escapes from Agra", "cast": {"shivaji": {"kind": "person", "name": "Shivaji"}, "palace": {"kind": "place", "name": "a palace in Agra", "words": ["palace", "agra"], "noun": "palace"}, "guards": {"kind": "group", "name": "Guards"}, "door": {"kind": "prop", "name": "his door"}, "baskets": {"kind": "prop", "name": "big baskets of sweets", "words": ["baskets", "basket"], "split_ok": true}, "porters": {"kind": "group", "name": "Two porters"}, "gate": {"kind": "place", "name": "the gate"}, "city": {"kind": "place", "name": "the city"}, "horse": {"kind": "animal", "name": "a horse"}, "tree": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a tree"}, "hills": {"kind": "place", "name": "the hills"}}, "lines": [{"text": "Shivaji was kept as a prisoner in a palace in Agra.", "ev": [], "rel": [["shivaji", "in", "palace"]]}, {"text": "Guards stood outside his door day and night.", "ev": [{"act": "stand", "by": "guards"}], "rel": [["guards", "next_to", "door"]]}, {"text": "Every evening big baskets of sweets were sent out of the palace.", "ev": [{"act": "leave", "by": "baskets", "to": "palace"}]}, {"text": "One evening Shivaji hid inside one of the baskets.", "ev": [{"act": "hide", "by": "shivaji", "to": "baskets"}], "rel": [["shivaji", "in", "baskets"]]}, {"text": "Two porters lifted the basket onto their shoulders.", "ev": [{"act": "lift", "by": "porters", "obj": "baskets"}], "rel": [["porters", "hold", "baskets"]]}, {"text": "They walked slowly past the guards and out of the gate.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "porters", "to": "gate"}]}, {"text": "Outside the city a horse was waiting under a tree.", "ev": [{"act": "wait", "by": "horse", "never": true}], "rel": [["horse", "under", "tree"]]}, {"text": "Shivaji climbed out of the basket and jumped onto the horse.", "ev": [{"act": "get_out", "by": "shivaji", "to": "baskets"}, {"act": "ride", "by": "shivaji", "to": "horse"}], "rel": [["shivaji", "ride", "horse"]], "end": [["shivaji", "in", "baskets"]]}, {"text": "He rode away fast towards his home in the hills.", "ev": [{"act": "go", "by": "shivaji", "to": "hills"}], "rel": [["shivaji", "towards", "hills"]]}]},
{"id": "h06", "genre": "history", "split": "test", "familiar": false, "title": "The bridge builders", "cast": {"river": {"kind": "place", "name": "A wide river"}, "villages": {"kind": "place", "name": "two villages"}, "people": {"kind": "group", "name": "the people"}, "ravi": {"kind": "person", "name": "An old carpenter named Ravi", "words": ["ravi", "carpenter"]}, "men": {"kind": "group", "name": "the men"}, "bamboo": {"kind": "prop", "name": "tall bamboo", "words": ["bamboo", "poles"]}, "forest": {"kind": "place", "name": "the forest"}, "rope": {"kind": "prop", "name": "strong rope", "words": ["rope"]}, "bridge": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the bridge"}, "girl": {"kind": "person", "name": "a little girl", "gender": "she"}, "rock": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a rock"}}, "lines": [{"text": "A wide river split two villages, and the people could not cross.", "ev": [], "rel": [["villages", "next_to", "river"]]}, {"text": "An old carpenter named Ravi gathered the men of both villages.", "ev": [{"act": "gather", "by": "ravi", "obj": "men"}]}, {"text": "They cut tall bamboo in the forest.", "ev": [{"act": "cut", "by": "men", "obj": "bamboo"}], "rel": [["men", "in", "forest"]]}, {"text": "The men carried the bamboo on their shoulders to the river.", "ev": [{"act": "carry", "by": "men", "obj": "bamboo"}, {"act": "walk", "by": "men", "to": "river"}], "rel": [["men", "hold", "bamboo"]]}, {"text": "Ravi tied the poles together with strong rope.", "ev": [{"act": "tie", "by": "ravi", "obj": "bamboo"}]}, {"text": "Day by day the bridge grew across the water.", "ev": [{"act": "grow", "by": "bridge"}]}, {"text": "At last a little girl walked across the new bridge.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "girl", "to": "bridge"}], "rel": [["girl", "on", "bridge"]]}, {"text": "The people on the other side clapped and cheered.", "ev": [{"act": "react", "by": "people", "val": "happy"}]}, {"text": "Ravi sat down on a rock and smiled.", "ev": [{"act": "sit_on", "by": "ravi", "to": "rock"}, {"act": "react", "by": "ravi", "val": "happy"}], "rel": [["ravi", "sit_on", "rock"]]}]},
{"id": "h07", "genre": "history", "split": "test", "familiar": true, "title": "Napoleon crosses the Alps", "cast": {"napoleon": {"kind": "person", "name": "Napoleon", "known": "napoleon"}, "army": {"kind": "group", "name": "his army", "words": ["army", "soldiers"]}, "alps": {"kind": "place", "name": "the high Alps", "words": ["alps"]}, "snow": {"kind": "agent", "name": "Snow"}, "path": {"kind": "place", "name": "the narrow mountain path", "words": ["path"]}, "mule": {"kind": "animal", "name": "a mule"}, "cannons": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the heavy cannons", "words": ["cannons"]}, "guide": {"kind": "person", "name": "A young guide"}, "ice": {"kind": "prop", "name": "the ice"}, "top": {"kind": "place", "name": "the top of the pass", "words": ["top", "pass"]}, "italy": {"kind": "place", "name": "Italy"}}, "lines": [{"text": "In 1800, Napoleon led his army towards the high Alps.", "ev": [{"act": "go", "by": "napoleon", "to": "alps"}, {"act": "follow", "by": "army", "to": "napoleon"}], "rel": [["napoleon", "towards", "alps"]]}, {"text": "Snow covered the narrow mountain path.", "ev": [{"act": "snow", "by": "snow"}], "rel": [["snow", "on", "path"]]}, {"text": "Napoleon rode a mule up the icy path.", "ev": [{"act": "ride", "by": "napoleon", "to": "mule"}, {"act": "go", "by": "napoleon", "to": "path"}], "rel": [["napoleon", "ride", "mule"]]}, {"text": "The soldiers pulled the heavy cannons on wooden sledges.", "ev": [{"act": "pull", "by": "army", "obj": "cannons"}]}, {"text": "A young guide walked in front of the mule.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "guide"}], "rel": [["guide", "in_front", "mule"]]}, {"text": "The guide slipped on the ice and fell.", "ev": [{"act": "fall", "by": "guide", "to": "ice"}]}, {"text": "Napoleon got off the mule and helped him up.", "ev": [{"act": "get_off", "by": "napoleon", "to": "mule"}, {"act": "help_up", "by": "napoleon", "to": "guide"}], "end": [["napoleon", "ride", "mule"]]}, {"text": "After five days they reached the top of the pass.", "ev": [{"act": "arrive", "by": "napoleon", "to": "top"}, {"act": "arrive", "by": "army", "to": "top"}]}, {"text": "Napoleon looked down at Italy and smiled.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "napoleon", "to": "italy"}, {"act": "react", "by": "napoleon", "val": "happy"}]}]},
{"id": "h08", "genre": "history", "split": "test", "familiar": false, "title": "The caravan in the desert", "cast": {"omar": {"kind": "person", "name": "A merchant named Omar", "words": ["omar", "merchant"]}, "camels": {"kind": "group", "name": "a caravan of camels", "words": ["caravan", "camels"]}, "desert": {"kind": "place", "name": "the desert"}, "camel": {"kind": "animal", "name": "the first camel", "words": ["camel"]}, "wind": {"kind": "agent", "name": "a strong wind", "words": ["wind", "storm"]}, "men": {"kind": "group", "name": "the men"}, "road": {"kind": "place", "name": "the road"}, "dune": {"kind": "place", "name": "a tall dune"}, "palms": {"kind": "prop", "name": "a line of palm trees", "words": ["palm", "trees", "line"], "noun": "trees"}, "oasis": {"kind": "place", "name": "the oasis"}}, "lines": [{"text": "A merchant named Omar led a caravan of camels across the desert.", "ev": [{"act": "go", "by": "omar", "to": "desert"}, {"act": "follow", "by": "camels", "to": "omar"}]}, {"text": "Omar rode on the first camel.", "ev": [{"act": "ride", "by": "omar", "to": "camel"}], "rel": [["omar", "ride", "camel"]]}, {"text": "In the afternoon a strong wind began to blow sand everywhere.", "ev": [{"act": "blow", "by": "wind"}]}, {"text": "The camels sat down and the men covered their faces.", "ev": [{"act": "sit", "by": "camels"}, {"act": "cover", "by": "men"}]}, {"text": "When the storm ended, Omar could not see the road.", "ev": [{"act": "not_see", "by": "omar", "never": true}]}, {"text": "He climbed a tall dune and looked around.", "ev": [{"act": "climb", "by": "omar", "to": "dune"}, {"act": "look_around", "by": "omar"}]}, {"text": "Far away he saw a line of palm trees.", "ev": [{"act": "look", "by": "omar", "to": "palms"}]}, {"text": "He pointed at the trees and shouted, water, there is water.", "ev": [{"act": "point", "by": "omar", "to": "palms"}, {"act": "shout", "by": "omar"}]}, {"text": "The whole caravan walked to the oasis and drank.", "ev": [{"act": "walk", "by": "camels", "to": "oasis"}, {"act": "drink", "by": "camels"}]}]}
]
